    <div class="article_head">
      <h2>
        包头市国资委关于印发《包头市属国有企业劳动用工管理办法》的通知
      </h2>
      <div class="article_tool">
        <div class="left">
          <div class="publish_date">发文时间：2023-01-18 16:57</div>
          <div class="counts" id="clickcounts"></div>
        </div>
